The files in this folder are the Lua 5.0 C API headers of LuaPlus build 1081
(lua.h, lauxlib.h, lualib.h, LuaLink.h, LuaPlusAddons.h, luace.h), with FAF
changes. The rest of LuaPlus is not used: the engine carries its own Lua VM.

